SUMMARY:Community Conversations
DESCRIPTION:The City of Durham’s Community Partnerships & Engagement (CPE) Department is hosting Community Conversations this November\, and they invite you to join! These conversations are an opportunity for Durham residents to share their ideas\, experiences\, and priorities to help inform the City’s budget decisions and future investments. \nAll participants will receive a $25 gift card! Meals\, childcare\, and Spanish interpretation will be available at all five citywide events. The November 18 event will be conducted entirely in Spanish. \nRegister here: https://forms.cloud.microsoft/g/4YxgNqms9g
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/community-conversations/
LOCATION:Multiple
END:VEVENT
