SUMMARY:Youth Photovoice Exhibit
DESCRIPTION:Refugee Community Partnership (RCP) invites you to join them at their office on 11/13 for a conversation about Food Access with refugee and migrant youths. RCP’s youths have been participating in a PhotoVoice project on food access and will be hosting a photo exhibit to showcase the work they’ve done. \nCome learn from immigrant and refugee youth who are using photography to tell stories about food culture and access in North Carolina. To learn more and RSVP\, visit Refugee Community Partnership or scan the QR code below! \n \n 
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/youth-photovoice-exhibit/
LOCATION:117 W Main St\, 117 W Main St\, Carrboro\, NC\, United States
END:VEVENT
