SUMMARY:What You Need to Know When a School Psychologist Completes an Evaluation
DESCRIPTION:Join NC Child and Inclusion Connects for a clear and practical conversation about what happens when a school psychologist completes an evaluation. You’ll learn how psychoeducational and psychological evaluations relate to each other\, where they differ\, and how each one helps build a fuller understanding of a child’s needs. The session offers straightforward guidance for parents\, caregivers\, and clinicians\, making the evaluation process easier to navigate and the results more meaningful to inform next steps. \nFor more information or to register\, click here!
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/what-you-need-to-know-when-a-school-psychologist-completes-an-evaluation/
LOCATION:Zoom
END:VEVENT
