SUMMARY:Keeping up with the Changes: Federal Food Policy Shifts and the Impact on State and Local Public Health Agencies
DESCRIPTION:The Network for Public Health Law invites you to join food safety experts for a webinar detailing recent changes to federal food safety policy. Speakers will discuss the likely impact of recent federal food safety policy on foodborne illness outbreaks; efforts to educate state and local policymakers on effective regulation of chemicals in our foods; and potential efforts at federal preemption. Hear from local public health leaders responsible for keeping their communities safe from\, and aware of\, foodborne illness outbreaks in the shadow of shifting federal regulatory changes. There will be ample time for audience engagement through a question-and-answer session. \nRegister here!
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/keeping-up-with-the-changes-federal-food-policy-shifts-and-the-impact-on-state-and-local-public-health-agencies/
LOCATION:Zoom
END:VEVENT
